      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "00655_naku_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{映画|えいが}→映画：02273_eiga⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{見|み}て→見る：00283_miru⟧{泣|な}きました。",
      "english": "I cried watching the movie.",
